子みたいだね」\nNG：乳首を噛む\n希望：可能であればバイノーラルマイクで、実際に舐めている感じでお願いしたいです。難しければ通常のマイクで問題ありません。\n希望の尺：10分～20分\n左右の比率：お任せしますが、右メインだと嬉しいです。\n\n以上はすべて希望ですので、難しいところがあれば変更しても問題ありません。\nご検討のほどよろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kotoka_11_28/works/271", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1800897575345930240%2F7FiQhwdM.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0b3814cda6c6ece1fc13ee541b06bb87", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1800897575345930240%2F7FiQhwdM.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0b3814cda6c6ece1fc13ee541b06bb87, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1800897575345930240%2F7FiQhwdM.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5f7d32cdb3ddbe531c5092afc0e1d413 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1800897575345930240%2F7FiQhwdM.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2145ba90140ca0cee2a0a54ceded93f4 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kotoka_11_28/works/270", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1800897575345930240%2F7FiQhwdM.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0b3814cda6c6ece